{"about_the_game":"<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >  <strong>Traverse several different slopes\u2014each with ramps, obstacles, and the occasional shortcut.</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686130/extras/73ce85afce033c00125fab5eac0e484e.poster.avif?t=1768962754\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686130/extras/73ce85afce033c00125fab5eac0e484e.webm?t=1768962754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686130/extras/73ce85afce033c00125fab5eac0e484e.mp4?t=1768962754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A tip from Yeti Mountain Ski Patrol:</i> <strong><i>AVOID THE ANIMALS</i></strong><i>.</i> They are <strong>not</strong> your friends; they will hit you, they will hurt you, and your fellow racers will not help you.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686130/extras/d9735fb3eefb38b162f9c9285aea77ae.poster.avif?t=1768962754\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686130/extras/d9735fb3eefb38b162f9c9285aea77ae.webm?t=1768962754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686130/extras/d9735fb3eefb38b162f9c9285aea77ae.mp4?t=1768962754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Use ramps to catch air and do tricks to build up your boost meter. Burn boost to speed past slower racers!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686130/extras/c729ee1a20a9723a72a2819e330f6251.poster.avif?t=1768962754\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686130/extras/c729ee1a20a9723a72a2819e330f6251.webm?t=1768962754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686130/extras/c729ee1a20a9723a72a2819e330f6251.mp4?t=1768962754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><i>A tip from the Yeti Mountain Ski Patrol:</i> <strong><i>LAND YOUR TRICKS.</i></strong> Trust us, the snow is not as soft as it looks; you <strong>don\u2019t</strong> want to hit it with your face. Make sure your <strong>board is under you</strong> and <strong>let go of all buttons</strong> to stick the landing.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686130/extras/6a76d96a71d6fdc9023629cc8f9b10ca.poster.avif?t=1768962754\" width=720 height=480 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686130/extras/6a76d96a71d6fdc9023629cc8f9b10ca.webm?t=1768962754\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686130/extras/6a76d96a71d6fdc9023629cc8f9b10ca.mp4?t=1768962754\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Pick up backpacks and use the items inside to battle it out with the other racers!</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3686130/extras/72f2d2fa49103ae83f4847242334d52e.poster.avif?t=1768962754\" width=720 heigh